    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>This healer record represents four separate versions: chaos, evil, good, or law. The subject gains +2 deflection AC and +2 resistance saves against creatures of the selected alignment. Existing possession and ongoing charm or compulsion control are suppressed, but resume if their own durations outlast this ward.</p><p>Summoned creatures of the selected alignment cannot touch the subject with natural attacks and recoil from contact. This barrier ends against a blocked creature if the subject attacks it or forces the barrier against it; that creature may also overcome the contact protection with spell resistance. The mental-control protection works regardless of alignment. The arcane version uses powdered silver to trace a 3-foot circle.</p><p><strong>Automation boundary:</strong> Choose one alignment version and apply conditional defenses, suppressed control, summoned-creature contact, and spell resistance manually.</p>"
    },
